{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_90","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"task-board resource update --help; task-board q 'schema()' | sed -n '1,240p'\"","aggregated_output":"Replace an existing file resource on a board element.\n\nSOURCE may be:\n  - a local filesystem path\n  - a file:// URL\n  - an http:// or https:// URL\n\nExamples:\n  task-board resource update TASK-260311-abc ./results.md --name TASK-260311-abc_results.md\n  task-board resource update TASK-260311-abc https://example.com/report.json --type outcome\n\nUsage:\n  task-board resource update <ELEMENT-ID> <SOURCE> [flags]\n\nFlags:\n  -d, --description string   Optional one-line description\n  -h, --help                 help for update\n      --name string          Override stored resource filename\n      --type string          Resource type: precondition or outcome (default \"outcome\")\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --board-dir string      Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \".task-board\")\n      --insecure              Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\n      --json                  Output in JSON format\n      --no-update-check       Disable automatic update check\n      --remote string         Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\n      --remote-board string   Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\n{\"defaultFields\":[\"id\",\"name\",\"status\"],\"fields\":[\"id\",\"type\",\"name\",\"title\",\"status\",\"review\",\"task_class\",\"estimate\",\"observability\",\"parent\",\"assignee\",\"description\",\"scope\",\"ac\",\"blockedBy\",\"blocks\",\"derivedBlockedBy\",\"derivedBlocks\",\"checklist\",\"notes\",\"created\",\"updated\",\"isBlocked\",\"isAdvisoryBlocked\",\"children\",\"preconditionResources\",\"outcomeResources\"],\"mutationMetadata\":{\"add_checklist_item\":{\"description\":\"Add a new checklist item\",\"parameters\":[{\"name\":\"id\",\"type\":\"string\",\"optional\":f